Real options.txt files written by the game itself, used by the settings-sync tests.

1.20.1.txt  Fabric 0.20.1 on Minecraft 1.20.1 (DataVersion 3465), demo mode, written when the
            accessibility onboarding screen was left (Escape) on the private test display.
1.21.4.txt  the same for Minecraft 1.21.4 (DataVersion 4189).
26.3.txt    vanilla Minecraft 26.3 (DataVersion 5023), from the e2e instance vanilla-latest.

Each passed through the launcher's options sanitiser (src/persist.rs) unchanged: the copy the
launcher carried back into the instance's persist/ was byte-identical.
